{"strongs": "H1419", "word": "גָּדוֺל", "translit": "ga.dol", "root": "גדול", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "great", "definition": "גָּדוֺל 522 adjective great — ׳ ג Gen 4:13 + 279 t.; גָּדֹל Deut 26:8 + 22 t.; construct גְּדוֺל Ezek 17:3 ; Ezek 17:7 ; Jer 32:19 , גְּדָלֿ Prov 19:19 , גְּדָו֯לֿ Ps 145:8 ; Nah 1:3 suffix גְּדוֺלָם Jer 6:13 + 2 t.; plural גְּדוֺלִים Exod 7:4 + 11 t., גְּדֹלִים Gen 12:17 + 22 t.; construct גְּדֹלֵי 2Kgs 10:6 suffix גְּדֹלָיו 2Kgs 10:11 ; Jonah 3:7 גְּדוֺלֶיהָ Nah 3:10 feminine גְּדוֺלָה Num 22:18 + 96 t.; גְּדֹלָה Gen 15:12 + 31 t.; plural גְּדוֺלֹת Neh 9:26 ; Neh 12:31 , גְּדֹלוֺת Deut 27:2 + 30 t., גְּדֹלֹת Num 13:28 + 7 t.; — great , 1. in magnitude and extent , e.g. sea Num 34:6 , river Gen 15:18 , wilderness Deut 1:19 , rain 1Kgs 18:45 , mountain Zech 4:7 , city Gen 10:12 , house Jer 52:13 , altar Josh 22:10 , throne 2Chr 9:17 , sea-monsters Gen 1:21 , fish Jonah 2:1 , eagle Ezek 17:3 , terebinth 2Sam 18:9 , substance Gen 15:14 , wealth Dan 11:2 , victory 1Sam 19:5 ; 1Sam 19:22 בּוֺר הַגָּדוֺל read הַגֹּרֶן ׳ ב according to ᵐ5 We Dr . 2. in number , e.g. nation Gen 12:2 , congregation Jer 31:8 , camp 1Chr 12:22 , army Ezek 17:17 , sacrifice 2Kgs 10:19 , slaughter Deut 28:59 ; 1Sam 4:17 . 3. in intensity , fear Deut 4:34 , weeping Isa 38:3 , power כּחַ Exod 32:11 , joy Jonah 4:6 , anger Deut 29:23 , indignation Jer 21:5 , sin Gen 20:9 , iniquity Gen 4:13 , evil Gen 39:9 , trespass Ezek 9:7 . 4. in sound, loud voice Gen 39:14 , cry Exod 11:6 , shout Josh 6:5 . 5. in age , elder, eldest, son Gen 27:1 , daughter Gen 29:16 , brother Gen 10:21 , sister Ezek 16:46 . 6. in importance , \\ \\ a. things (הַ)דָּבָר (הַ)גָּדֹל an important thing or affair Exod 18:22 ; Deut 4:32 ; 1Sam 12:16 ; 2Kgs 5:12 ; 2Kgs 8:13 יום יהוה Jer 30:7 ; Hos 2:2 ; Joel 2:11 ; Joel 3:4 ; Zeph 1:14 ; Mal 3:23 . \\ \\ b. of men, great, distinguished , Moses Exod 11:3 , David 2Sam 5:10 , Job Job 1:3 , Mordecai Esth 9:4 , kings Eccl 9:14 ; Jer 27:7 especially of king of Assyr. הַמֶּלֶךְ הַגָּדוֺל 2Kgs 18:19 ; 2Kgs 18:28 = Isa 36:4 ; Isa 36:18 , = Assyrian šarru rabbu, šarru dannu, e.g. KB i. 94, 1. 1 ; הַכֹּהֵן הַגָּדוֺל the h.p. Lev 21:10 + 20 t.; (הָ)אִישׁ גָּדוֺל 1Sam 25:2 ; 2Sam 19:33 ; 2Kgs 5:1 אִשָּׁה גְדוֺלָה 2Kgs 4:8 גָּדוֺל a great man 2Sam 3:38 ; Mic 7:3 לֹא תֶהְדַּר פְּנֵי גָדוֺל thou shalt not honour (favour) the person of a great man (opposed to דָּל ) Lev 19:15 ( H ); (הַ)גְּדוֺלִים the great 2Sam 7:9 = 1Chr 17:8 ; Neh 11:14 (see below) Prov 18:16 ; Prov 25:6 ; Jer 5:5 ( 2Kgs 10:11 ᵐ5 L ἀγχιστεύοντας , Klo גֹּאֲלָיו ); further גְּדֹלֵי הָעִיר 2Kgs 10:6 (כָּלֿ)גְּדֹלָיו 2Kgs 10:11 ; Jonah 3:7 כָּלֿ גְּדוֺלֶיהָ Nah 3:10 . \\ \\ c. of God, himself 2Chr 2:4 ; Neh 4:8 ; Neh 8:6 ; Ps 86:10 ; Ps 99:2 ; Ps 135:5 ; Ps 147:5 ; Isa 12:6 ; Jer 10:6 (הָ)אֵל (הַ)גָּדוֺל Deut 7:21 ; Deut 10:17 ; Neh 1:5 ; Neh 9:32 ; Ps 77:14 ; Ps 95:3 ; Jer 32:18 ; Dan 9:4 גדול מכל האלהים Exod 18:11 גדול ומהלל מאד 1Chr 16:25 ; Ps 48:2 ; Ps 96:4 ; Ps 145:3 מלך גדול Ps 47:3 ; Ps 95:3 ; Mal 1:14 his works Deut 11:7 ; Judg 2:7 ; Ps 111:2 , glory Ps 21:6 ; Ps 138:5 , name Josh 7:9 ; 1Sam 12:22 ; 1Kgs 8:42 ; 2Chr 6:32 ; Ps 76:2 ; Ps 99:3 ; Jer 10:6 ; Jer 44:26 ; Ezek 36:23 ; Mal 1:11 (twice in verse), mercy 1Kgs 3:6 ; 2Chr 1:8 ; Ps 57:11 ; Ps 86:13 ; Ps 108:5 , goodness Neh 9:25 , compassion Isa 54:7 . 7. in phrases עוֺד הַיּוֺם גָּדוֺל it is yet high day (French grand jour , German hoch am Tage , the day is at its height) Gen 29:7 כַּקָּטֹן כַּגָּדֹל (or reverse) as well small as great Deut 1:17 ; 1Chr 25:8 ; 1Chr 26:13 ; 2Chr 31:15 (לְ)מִקָּטֹן וְעַד גָּדוֺל (or reverse) from small to great Gen 19:11 ; 1Sam 5:9 ; 1Sam 30:2 ; 1Sam 30:19 ; 2Kgs 23:2 ; 2Kgs 25:26 ; 2Chr 15:13 ; 2Chr 34:30 ; Esth 1:5 ; Esth 1:20 ; Jer 6:13 ; Jer 8:10 ; Jer 31:34 ; Jer 42:1 ; Jer 42:8 ; Jer 44:12 ; Jonah 3:5 . 8. construct גְּדֹל (הַ)כְּנָפַיִם great of wings Ezek 17:8 ; Ezek 17:7 , so of anger Prov 19:19 ( Qr ); usually of God, in power Nah 1:3 , counsel Jer 32:19 , mercy Ps 145:8 . 9. as substantive concrete עשׂה גדלות do great things , of God's great acts of redemption and judgement Deut 10:21 ; Job 5:9 ; Job 9:10 ; Job 37:5 ; Ps 71:19 ; Ps 106:21 of the miracles of Elisha 2Kgs 8:4 of things too great and so presumptuous, haughty ׳ תבקשׁ ג Jer 45:5 ׳ מדברת ג Ps 12:4 לא ׳ הלכתי בג Ps 131:1 (compare Biblical Aramaic Dan 7:8 ; Dan 7:11 ; Dan 7:20 also Rev 13:5 ). 10. as substantive neuter greatness of arm Exod 15:16 compare גָּבֹהַּ 4.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1498')\">BDB1498</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1419')\">H1419</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1497')\">BDB1497</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1499')\">BDB1499</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גָּדוֺל</bdbheb><sub>522</sub> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>great</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ג</bdbheb><ref ref=\"Gen 4:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,13)\">Gen 4:13</ref> + 279 t.; <bdbheb>גָּדֹל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 26:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,8)\">Deut 26:8</ref> + 22 t.; construct <bdbheb>גְּדוֺל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,3)\">Ezek 17:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,7)\">Ezek 17:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 32:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,19)\">Jer 32:19</ref>, <bdbheb>גְּדָלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 19:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,19,19)\">Prov 19:19</ref>, <bdbheb>גְּדָו֯לֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 145:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"145\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"145\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,145,8)\">Ps 145:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Nah 1:3\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(34,1,3)\">Nah 1:3</ref> suffix <bdbheb>גְּדוֺלָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 6:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,13)\">Jer 6:13</ref> + 2 t.; plural <bdbheb>גְּדוֺלִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 7:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,4)\">Exod 7:4</ref> + 11 t., <bdbheb>גְּדֹלִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 12:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,12,17)\">Gen 12:17</ref> + 22 t.; construct <bdbheb>גְּדֹלֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,6)\">2Kgs 10:6</ref> suffix <bdbheb>גְּדֹלָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,11)\">2Kgs 10:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 3:7\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(32,3,7)\">Jonah 3:7</ref> <bdbheb>גְּדוֺלֶיהָ</bdbheb><ref ref=\"Nah 3:10\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,10)\">Nah 3:10</ref> feminine <bdbheb>גְּדוֺלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 22:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,18)\">Num 22:18</ref> + 96 t.; <bdbheb>גְּדֹלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 15:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,12)\">Gen 15:12</ref> + 31 t.; plural <bdbheb>גְּדוֺלֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:26\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,26)\">Neh 9:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:31\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,31)\">Neh 12:31</ref>, <bdbheb>גְּדֹלוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 27:2\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(5,27,2)\">Deut 27:2</ref> + 30 t., <bdbheb>גְּדֹלֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 13:28\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,28)\">Num 13:28</ref> + 7 t.; — <highlight>great</highlight>, <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>in magnitude and extent</highlight>, e.g. sea <ref ref=\"Num 34:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,34,6)\">Num 34:6</ref>, river <ref ref=\"Gen 15:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,18)\">Gen 15:18</ref>, wilderness <ref ref=\"Deut 1:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,19)\">Deut 1:19</ref>, rain <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:45\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,45)\">1Kgs 18:45</ref>, mountain <ref ref=\"Zech 4:7\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(38,4,7)\">Zech 4:7</ref>, city <ref ref=\"Gen 10:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,12)\">Gen 10:12</ref>, house <ref ref=\"Jer 52:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,52,13)\">Jer 52:13</ref>, altar <ref ref=\"Josh 22:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,10)\">Josh 22:10</ref>, throne <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,17)\">2Chr 9:17</ref>, sea-monsters <ref ref=\"Gen 1:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,21)\">Gen 1:21</ref>, fish <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:1\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,1)\">Jonah 2:1</ref>, eagle <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,3)\">Ezek 17:3</ref>, terebinth <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,9)\">2Sam 18:9</ref>, substance <ref ref=\"Gen 15:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,14)\">Gen 15:14</ref>, wealth <ref ref=\"Dan 11:2\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,2)\">Dan 11:2</ref>, victory <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,5)\">1Sam 19:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:22\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,22)\">1Sam 19:22</ref> <bdbheb>בּוֺר הַגָּדוֺל</bdbheb> read <bdbheb>הַגֹּרֶן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>in number</highlight>, e.g. nation <ref ref=\"Gen 12:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,12,2)\">Gen 12:2</ref>, congregation <ref ref=\"Jer 31:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,8)\">Jer 31:8</ref>, camp <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:22\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,22)\">1Chr 12:22</ref>, army <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,17)\">Ezek 17:17</ref>, sacrifice <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,19)\">2Kgs 10:19</ref>, slaughter <ref ref=\"Deut 28:59\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"59\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"59\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,59)\">Deut 28:59</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,17)\">1Sam 4:17</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>in intensity</highlight>, fear <ref ref=\"Deut 4:34\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,34)\">Deut 4:34</ref>, weeping <ref ref=\"Isa 38:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,3)\">Isa 38:3</ref>, power <bdbheb>כּחַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,11)\">Exod 32:11</ref>, joy <ref ref=\"Jonah 4:6\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(32,4,6)\">Jonah 4:6</ref>, anger <ref ref=\"Deut 29:23\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,23)\">Deut 29:23</ref>, indignation <ref ref=\"Jer 21:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,5)\">Jer 21:5</ref>, sin <ref ref=\"Gen 20:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,9)\">Gen 20:9</ref>, iniquity <ref ref=\"Gen 4:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,13)\">Gen 4:13</ref>, evil <ref ref=\"Gen 39:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,39,9)\">Gen 39:9</ref>, trespass <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,7)\">Ezek 9:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>in sound, loud</highlight> voice <ref ref=\"Gen 39:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,39,14)\">Gen 39:14</ref>, cry <ref ref=\"Exod 11:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,11,6)\">Exod 11:6</ref>, shout <ref ref=\"Josh 6:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,5)\">Josh 6:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>in age</highlight>, elder, eldest, son <ref ref=\"Gen 27:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,1)\">Gen 27:1</ref>, daughter <ref ref=\"Gen 29:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,16)\">Gen 29:16</ref>, brother <ref ref=\"Gen 10:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,21)\">Gen 10:21</ref>, sister <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:46\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,46)\">Ezek 16:46</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <highlight>in importance</highlight>, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>things</highlight> <bdbheb>(הַ)דָּבָר (הַ)גָּדֹל</bdbheb> <highlight>an important thing</highlight> or <highlight>affair</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 18:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,22)\">Exod 18:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:32\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,32)\">Deut 4:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,16)\">1Sam 12:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,12)\">2Kgs 5:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,13)\">2Kgs 8:13</ref> <bdbheb>יום יהוה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 30:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,7)\">Jer 30:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 2:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,2)\">Hos 2:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 2:11\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,11)\">Joel 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 3:4\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(29,3,4)\">Joel 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:14\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,14)\">Zeph 1:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 3:23\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,23)\">Mal 3:23</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>of men, great, distinguished</highlight>, Moses <ref ref=\"Exod 11:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,11,3)\">Exod 11:3</ref>, David <ref ref=\"2Sam 5:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\